  + provenance therefore passes while exact frame identity changes

& [Decision] is conditional exact binding
  + parse only deliberately structured declarations
  + compare each declared field after the same normalization used for grounding
  + retain literal grounding for undeclared fields without inventing their roles
  + require complete closed structure for whole-document JSON

& [CandidateCorrection] is refined by SJS
  + the source candidate proposed complete-set-only activation
  + the preserved observed stimulus does not label subject and would bypass that rule
  + field-local binding is therefore required to satisfy the observed purpose without general natural-language parsing

& [Value] is attention-language procedure fidelity
  + structured input behaves more like typed program I/O
  + learned selection remains flexible while host binding preserves caller field identity
  + faults explain which fields changed without echoing values

& [Deferred] is a richer grammar escaped delimiters nested values semantic aliases and general natural-language role labeling
